TI  - Biochar mitigates microplastic‐induced destabilization of soil organic carbon via molecular recalcitrance and microbial process regulation
AU  - Xinghong Cao
AU  - Jie Liu
AU  - Jiaqi Ren
AU  - Yalan Chen
